      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "It\u2019s just another ordinary day\u2026\nuntil the zombie and human
    housemates start hurling everything they can find across the kitchen counter!\nChairs,
    plates, and random household stuff fly through the air\u2014\nWho will give up
    first in this wild home battle?\n\nWith every throw, the wind inside the house
    can change the game\u2014\naim for the head, dodge flying objects, and outsmart
    your opponent!\nWill the human claim victory, or will the zombie take over the
    house?\n\nWho will rule the living room tonight?\nReady, set\u2026 THROW!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0161d805a3764c089bef00bfe00793f5, type: 2}
